+"""Level-1 explorer for the harness (kojimatech, 2026-10-02).
+
+The LLM-free state-graph explorer that the ECA-EXPLORE and ECA-ORACLE lines adopted as
+`arcgym.heldout.policies.explore_habit_level1_nearest_fvl` (FL), vendored as ONE module with no module-level state, no
+file reads and no imports beyond numpy. The decisions are the sources' line for line; only the plumbing differs: the
+sources monkey-patch module attributes of a frozen instrument, here the same functions are methods of one object.
+
+Sources (pinned):
+  flyexec_explore_run.py         sha256 ba1a4c9b274c8ea7...  key_of, set_hud, bfs_path      (ECA-EXPLORE, ce50bf98)
+  flyexec_carrydead_instr.py     sha256 dae345614a35f43a...  actions_for (components + dead-site order), pick_target
