+# --- FRZ-EXPECT (kojimatech, 2026-10-03; docs/frz_expect_refutation_2026-10-03.md) ----------------------------------------
+# The model may state what an action() call will do; the solver compares and answers HELD / REFUTED. Everything here
+# is inert unless ECA_FRZ_EXPECT=1: the argument is dropped before it reaches the solver, and no prompt text changes.
+def _expect_enabled() -> bool:
+    return str(os.environ.get("ECA_FRZ_EXPECT", "0") or "0").strip() == "1"
